        "content": "<p>fitzgen opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/15224\">PR #15224</a> from <code>fitzgen:no-try-call-for-host-intrinsics</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Rather than <code>try_call</code>s, whose ABI requires spilling all registers.</p>\n<p>Doesn't really provide a difference on Sightglass when inlining is disabled, since we end up spilling for the various calls anyways in that case, but with inlining enabled it is a nice speed up:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">execution</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">instructions</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">retired</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">cm</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">online</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">no</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"kr\">try</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">call</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">Cinlining</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">1.14402</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">to</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">1.14403</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">faster</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">than</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">Cinlining</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">!</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">confidence</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">99</span><span class=\"o\">%</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.0001</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"err\">┌───────────┬───────────┬──────────────┬──────────────┬────────┬────────────────────────────┐</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"err\">│</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Min</span><span class=\"w\">       </span><span class=\"err\">│</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Max</span><span class=\"w\">       </span><span class=\"err\">│</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mean</span><span class=\"w\">         </span><span class=\"err\">│</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Median</span><span class=\"w\">       </span><span class=\"err\">│</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Noise</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"err\">│</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Engine</span><span class=\"w\">                     </span><span class=\"err\">│</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"err\">├───────────┼───────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┼────────┼────────────────────────────┤</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"err\">│</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">142345361</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"err\">│</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">142472755</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"err\">│</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">142350944.05</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"err\">│</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span c